      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "1b338bc037eee0b31b391a067667dee0580f72296bf8d88c909dcd979697c2cb:000000_-8079075207968447896:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ゲシュペンス島に甘い香りが漂うバレンタイン。\nその前日に食堂の中を覗くと、\nチョコをぐるぐるとかき混ぜるシジメさんがいた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
