      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ほ、本当ですかっ……？\nこ、こんなじめじめしたキノコ女が、\n何を浮かれてるんだって思ってませんか……？",
      "jp_sha256": "751aef26cec1790726a647287d6cb6db41650587f860eb5801a93361cde5c814",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "저, 정말인가요……?\n이, 이렇게 축축한 버섯 여자가,\n뭘 들떠 있느냐고 생각하지 않으셨어요……?",
      "message_index_0based": 5,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 15,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
